  "description": "Conversion of first and second floor flat (1 x 3\r\nbed) to three flats (1 x 2 bed, 1 x 1 bed, and 1 x studio); two storey rear\r\nextension; two storey rear dormer; single storey rear extension and part\r\nconversion of ground floor shop to provide 1 no 1-bed flat (Use Class C3); bin\r\nand cycle stores; external alterations&nbsp;(demolition of outbuilding)",
